   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Polite requests and professional wishes",
     "texto": [
      "Instead of the imperative or the direct «ich will», standard usage prefers: **Ich würde gern einen Termin vereinbaren** (I'd like to arrange an appointment); **Würden Sie mir bitte die Unterlagen schicken?** (Would you be so kind as to send me the documents?); **Wir würden uns sehr über Ihren Besuch freuen** (We would be delighted by your visit).",
      "Sentence structure: the conjugated auxiliary (**würde / würden**) takes second position (or first in questions) and the infinitive showing the action goes at the end."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Politeness with würde",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Person",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Form of würde",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example with infinitive",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
